\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.3}{\ignorespaces Data filtering and preprocessing pipeline showing the systematic approach to ensuring data quality and consistency across interior images, floor plans, and property specifications. The flowchart illustrates the multi-stage filtering process from raw data collection to the final integrated dataset.}}{11}{figure.caption.9}%
